  "story": {
    "title": "Clean Cat",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "This is my house. Ma, Pa and Cheena also live here.",
      "The best chair in the house is for me. But sitting on the lap is even better, isn’t it?",
      "Cheena is my best friend. I wait for her to return from school.",
      "I keep myself clean without water. I do not need a bath like Tommy.",
      "Shhh... don’t tell anyone that I am hiding here. 1... 2... 3... Got you!",
      "Ma shouts at me, when I bring some tasty food from the garden.",
      "I can climb trees. I can jump. I know all the short cuts here.",
      "Sanju lives nearby. He teases me. It makes me very angry.",
      "Please tell Sanju that the tiger is from our cat family. We have sharp claws.",
      "My friends sometimes make a lot of noise at night. By then I am quietly in bed.",
      "Tails can speak! Did you know how animals and birds tell us something by using their tails? A dog wags its tail when it is happy. A cat puffs up its tail when it is angry. Often we say, “As clean as a cat”. This is because cats do not like water, yet they are always keeping themselves clean by licking themselves."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "This is my house.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây là nhà của tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ma, Pa and Cheena also live here.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ, Ba và Cheena cũng sống ở đây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The best chair in the house is for me.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cái ghế tốt nhất trong nhà là dành cho tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But sitting on the lap is even better, isn’t it?",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng ngồi trên lòng thì còn thích hơn nữa, phải không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Cheena is my best friend.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cheena là bạn thân nhất của tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I wait for her to return from school.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi đợi cô ấy đi học về."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I keep myself clean without water.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi tự giữ mình sạch sẽ mà không cần nước."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I do not need a bath like Tommy.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi không cần tắm như Tommy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shhh... don’t tell anyone that I am hiding here.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Suỵt... đừng nói với ai là tôi đang trốn ở đây nhé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "1... 2... 3... Got you!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "1... 2... 3... Bắt được rồi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ma shouts at me, when I bring some tasty food from the garden.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ la tôi khi tôi mang đồ ăn ngon từ vườn về."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I can climb trees.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi có thể trèo cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I can jump.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi có thể nhảy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I know all the short cuts here.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tôi biết tất cả các đường tắt ở đây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sanju lives nearby.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sanju sống ở gần đây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He teases me.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu ấy hay trêu chọc tôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It makes me very angry.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Điều đó làm tôi rất tức giận."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Please tell Sanju that the tiger is from our cat family.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Làm ơn nói với Sanju rằng hổ là họ hàng với mèo nhà mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "We have sharp claws.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng tôi có móng vuốt sắc nhọn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My friends sometimes make a lot of noise at night.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn bè của tôi đôi khi làm ồn ào rất nhiều vào ban đêm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "By then I am quietly in bed.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Lúc đó thì tôi đã yên lặng ở trên giường rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Tails can speak!",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đuôi có thể nói chuyện!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Did you know how animals and birds tell us something by using their tails?",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn có biết động vật và chim chóc nói cho chúng ta điều gì đó bằng cách dùng đuôi của chúng không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A dog wags its tail when it is happy.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một chú chó vẫy đuôi khi nó vui vẻ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A cat puffs up its tail when it is angry.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một chú mèo xù đuôi lên khi nó tức giận."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Often we say, “As clean as a cat”.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng ta thường nói, “Sạch như mèo”."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This is because cats do not like water, yet they are always keeping themselves clean by licking themselves.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_1057/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Điều này là vì mèo không thích nước, nhưng chúng luôn giữ mình sạch sẽ bằng cách tự liếm lông."
      }
    ]
  },
